{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7680a48793977c42d1e13ec33f16cfe6d377043280d19fd65e0a9cbf1afa0f6", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、プロ野球のイベント出演。\nもうすぐ開幕だけど、昴の様子がおかしいような……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是职棒的活动表演。\n马上就要开幕了，昴的样子却怪怪的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f7d52396da1a063245f3ec6ddcd0fd309f98fdb5feef9ce41892ae8cd3ad3c09", "ja": "昴？　どうしたんだ、\nそんなに暗い顔をして……。", "zh": "昴？怎么了？\n这么没有精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "397c13d45d94e845b14046953070db864d6fae068fde2cb14ca6b8d1eb302d76", "ja": "なんか、もうすぐ本番だと思ったら、\n急にすっげー緊張してきちゃってさ……。", "zh": "一想到快要正式上台，\n我就突然觉得好紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "5aaa02bb1227519341fd9bb6de6d7acf4e8487dd8387b0ffd4ea888d03ed7ce4", "ja": "せっかく昨日、のり子たちとパーッと遊んで、\nリラックスできたと思ってたのに～！", "zh": "亏我昨天还跟法子她们大玩特玩，\n以为自己已经放松了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "79c82ee31068b9899665102be86582aff08f45fad157596e5f4f4d020fa9a3a5", "ja": "球場のイベントは初めてじゃないだろ？\nいつもの調子でやれば、大丈夫だ！", "zh": "球场的活动不是第一次参加了吧？\n只要照平常的感觉去做就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "297826a450548625d91defe516768229854a379f65bccd8b62d7e42900ac9efa", "ja": "{$P$}のことは信じてるけど……。\n心臓のバクバクが止まらないんだよ～！", "zh": "我相信{$P$}说的……\n可是我心脏一直跳得好快喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "6919e8cbcc92978219907fdb72fbd407543469d1038348f0014487c682416f5f", "ja": "うう、どうしよう……。今日はオレの好きな\n選手が出る試合だってのに、このままじゃ……。", "zh": "呜呜，怎么办……\n今天的比赛我喜欢的选手会上场，再这样下去的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2fe146547e5223f63676a5c94acf425527671a4ad502cd722bfc3861ef161e63", "ja": "もしかしてそのせいじゃないか？　昴。\n憧れの選手がいるから、余計に緊張するとか……。", "zh": "昴，原因该不会就出在这里吧？\n因为崇拜的选手在场，才更觉得紧张之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "3d63fef04b34131532099a3ea29d3ce72998d8580f2a8e1b546fdc9ee0e24308", "ja": "あっ……言われてみれば、そうかも。\nでも、どうしたらいいんだよ～。", "zh": "啊……这么一说，好像是耶。\n可是要怎么办才好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1010_p", "source_sha256": "788f622fdde2bc56c6ed610529eaee5880723124ef958c301b85905c5a1a27f5", "ja": "そうだな……いっそ、全力をやめてみたらどうだ？\n肩の力を抜いて、リラックスして歌う！", "zh": "这个嘛……干脆不要尽全力，你觉得怎么样？\n不要太紧绷，放轻松演唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "5a222a1ccaf46a266f0d84b6c1d272372cb3c3d9654ff671e82a47949fa9cbfa", "ja": "えぇっ！？　でも{$P$}、\nそれって手を抜くってことなんじゃ……。", "zh": "咦咦！？可是，{$P$}，\n这样不就等于敷衍了事吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "035f6292952160e4705aa48bf8f561f946e9e46adddaf1e76b8774993cbeab20", "ja": "いくら{$P$}の指示でも、\nオレ、お客さんの前で手を抜くなんてできないよ！", "zh": "就算是{$P$}的指示，\n我也没办法在观众面前敷衍了事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bdc2f733fa2c17f4b474eb7e6b7e1945d0b5e6313a7a919bc952d2000eebe433", "ja": "手を抜くとかの話じゃないよ、昴。\n野球だって、全力でスイングしてばかりじゃないだろ？", "zh": "昴，我不是要你敷衍了事。\n就算是打棒球，也不会一直用全力挥棒呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e58510e10f397cbccc63a769d532c406a937729fdba757e352142851e955872b", "ja": "相手選手とか試合の戦術によって、\nいろいろな打ち方をしているはずだ。", "zh": "应该会根据对手或比赛战术的不同，\n选择各式各样的打法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "630613aa3bf93b028d183f30a0622103d2acf13845aaed682411fb4fa32abb57", "ja": "なるほど……たしかにピッチャーの\n投げる球で、いろんな打ち方するよな！　そっか！", "zh": "有道理……选手确实会根据投手投的球，\n选用不同的打法！原来是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "583a6a235ad955c179d7621ad6128b7905ae9b098816da943db087479b9d23f5", "ja": "オレも全力で歌うだけじゃなくて、もっと\nいろんな歌い方すればいいんだ……って、あれ？", "zh": "我也不一定要尽全力演唱，\n可以有更多不一样的唱法……呃，奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "d6aba954c98d15dc76f8837ea52fa25c15e9cdd81d64c1ed6dee29dc93cbcf28", "ja": "なんか、{$P$}と話してたら\nあんまり緊張しなくなってきたかも！", "zh": "跟{$P$}聊着聊着，\n好像就没有那么紧张了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d3fd44ece3f9b9a4fd8c300a79a54604e64866a63cd9311cd564a81b0e8a91f1", "ja": "はは、そうか。なら今日のライブは大丈夫だな。\n頼んだぞ、昴！", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊，那今天的演唱会没问题了呢。\n拜托你啰，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "994d82ae68d22997df8a5c403823e26dbbafd60b49657ab199028ad47476e5bb", "ja": "へへっ、まかせてくれよ！　どんな球でも\n打ち返して、最高のステージにしてやるぜ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧！不管是怎样的球，\n我都会打回去，带来最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0133_1020_p", "source_sha256": "01419e698c76566b140f35ba6e9b8c4490a1196270c17f59ebf134030100c3d0", "ja": "（結局、昴には全力で頑張るのがあってるのかもな。\nともあれ緊張が解けてよかった。頑張れ、昴！）", "zh": "（结果，昴好像还是适合全力以赴呢。\n总之能顺利缓解紧张感真是太好了，昴，加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
